        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Palampore in white silk embroidered in coloured silks and gold thread. With an elaborate floral trellis design emblazoned with a large coat-of-arms of a Dutch family in the centre and on each of the four corners. Narrow border of floral scrollwork."@en ;
